                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <p class="oj-normal">28.</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <span>If the undertaking also reports on the Comprehensive module, it shall complement the information provided under B2 with the datapoints found in C2.</span>
                     </td>
                  </tr>
               </tbody>
            </table>
            <p id="d1e911-7-1" class="oj-ti-grseq-1">BASIC MODULE – ENVIRONMENT METRICS</p>
