                        <p class="oj-normal">16.</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <span>In order to understand the sustainability issues that relate to social and human rights, refer to Appendix B for a list of possible sustainability issues. This list could help identify if the policies, practices or future initiatives are aimed at addressing negative human rights <span class="oj-bold">
