            <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1" id="d1e3080-35-1">1.3.   <span class="oj-bold">Basic Module Guidance – Social Metrics</span>
            </p>
            <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1" id="d1e3089-35-1">B8 –   <span class="oj-bold">Workforce – General characteristics</span>
